Subject: [PATCH 027/211] ASoC: codecs: tas2559: Add initial tas255x audio
 amplifier codec

Introduce the TAS2557 and TAS2559 audio codec.

Original author: Joel Selvaraj <joel.devbox@protonmail.com>

[David] Merged the 2557 and 2559 into the one driver, multiple
improvements.

Signed-off-by: David Heidelberg <david@ixit.cz>
